SCIENCE REVIEW — BLOCK exact ed5776e8d4a1e5f7f7fdf8951d03d371bb58c516b0cf4ee9f71c4a68c8c20f73 with two concrete repairs.

Verified 17,790 bytes. P/F semantics PASS: explicit posterior zeroes, sparse F keys plus adjacent-row membership, nonrenormalized visible branches with retained remainder, external-state separation, Viterbi as a removable summary, and omission refusal all match current source and the frozen visualization court.

BLOCK 1 — §5 collapses segmentation back into semantic support. It defines segmentation as exact, possibly discontinuous transcript supports for proposed recall units. The integrity contract separates contiguous cells/boundaries from overlapping or discontinuous semantic/evidence supports, joined many-to-many. The minimum report likewise shows recall rows/supports but does not separately require the cell plan and incidence mapping.

Concrete patch:
- segmentation = exact contiguous cells and boundaries on a declared transcript coordinate, with eligible mask/exclusions and competing split/merge plans;
- interpretation/evidence = separately identified semantic artifacts whose supports may overlap or be discontinuous;
- incidence = explicit many-to-many cell/artifact mapping plus compatibility outcome and receipt;
- add incidence/compatibility identities to Construction family and the selected witness to Fixed view in §4;
- in §7 render separate layers for contiguous cells/boundaries, overlapping/discontinuous semantic supports, and their incidence links. A fixed-view row is not silently renamed a cell.

BLOCK 2 — construction source-use and anti-circularity are not published. The invocation receives the source bundle before constructing/pruning/qualifying the recall family, but no field states whether source candidates or downstream P/F/signature influenced those choices. A source-informed interpretation can therefore render as an independent recall-to-source alignment.

Concrete patch:
- declare this baseline recall construction and fixed-view qualification source-blind: they consume recall observation/derivation plus their declared recipes, never source nominations, P, F, Viterbi, signature, or alignment endpoints;
- bind the construction source-use mode and a feature-use/lineage ledger into family, projection, result, and report identity;
- if a later source-informed diagnostic child is allowed, label it explicitly, preserve its informing source identity, and forbid it from masquerading as the primary source-frozen alignment;
- show that conditioning on the first screen beside diagnostic/not-calibrated.

Two small coherence edits ride with those patches: §5 should require the adopted artifact under construction-integrity bead bd-01M1EA8J4KFQRHZ5SF326B6WFZ rather than hard-code revision 3, which has been returned; and §7 item 6 should display construction route, conformance, authenticity, use admission, and calibration separately, with provider identity only where present.

These are the complete blockers in my assigned science/P-F seat. On corrected exact bytes I will re-review only these items.
